2","id":220087257,"node_id":"U_kgDODR5D2Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220087257?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selestor1462","html_url":"https://github.com/Selestor1462","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selestor1462/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selestor1462/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selestor1462/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selestor1462/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selestor1462/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selestor1462/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selestor1462/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selestor1462/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selestor1462/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-28T19:07:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T06:17:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In 26.3 release the search between schematics doesn't start when clicking any keyboard key in \"Load schematics\" and \"Schematic Manager\" menus, but still works in configs menu. Sidenote: In configs menu it works only for the first time, if you search in configs, then stop searching and try to search again, it wont allow you. Added video reproduction, on it I'm rapidly pressing keyboard keys\nMy agent seem to have fixed it in [this branch](https://github.com/Selestor1462/litematica/commit/ba9ea4bf2347c4cb6d7c6b9be1ee770c0c319c0c) but its fully vibecoded, so im not PR-ing it. I didn't fully understand why issue occurs and wasn't able to fix it myself.\nTesting environment:\n26.3 fresh instance\nmalilib 0.30.2\nlitematica 0.29.1\nfabric loader 0.19.5\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2018ffed-e889-4e5d-86a7-ce32e1a54ffe","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakura-ryoko/litematica/issues/401/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakura-ryoko/litematica/issues/401/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakura-ryoko/litematica/issues/400","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakura-ryoko/litematica","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakura-ryoko/litematica/issues/400/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakura-ryoko/litematica/issues/400/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakura-ryoko/litematica/issues/400/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sakura-ryoko/litematica/issues/400","id":5565310295,"node_id":"I_kwDOKySvqs8AAAABS7flVw","number":400,"title":"[1.12.2 Forge] NPE in RenderGlobalSchematic.func_174970_a / Litematica crash on world load","user":{"login":"MaKuZan","id":178612706,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqVp4g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178612706?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaKuZan","html_url":"https://github.com/MaKuZan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaKuZan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaKuZan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaKuZan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaKuZan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaKuZan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaKuZan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaKuZan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaKuZan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaKuZan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-09-24T08:10:48Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T14:06:11Z","closed_at":"2026-09-26T14:06:11Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Description\nThe game crashes immediately upon loading or creating any world when Litematica is enabled. Disabling OptiFine options (like Fast Render) does not resolve the issue; only removing Litematica prevents the crash.\n\n### Environment\n- **Minecraft Version:** 1.12.2[cite: 1]\n- **Forge Version:** 14.23.5.2859[cite: 1]\n- **Litematica Version:** `0.0.0-dev.20191217.195055` (Forge port)[cite: 1]\n- **MaLiLib Version:** `0.10.0-dev.23.nomixin`[cite: 1]\n- **OptiFine:** `OptiFine_1.12.2_HD_U_G5`[cite: 1]\n- **GPU:** Intel UHD Graphics (Driver 32.0.101.7088)[cite: 1]\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n1. Launch Minecraft 1.12.2 with Forge, Litematica, MaLiLib, and OptiFine installed[cite: 1].\n2. Create or load any world (Singleplayer or Multiplayer)[cite: 1].\n3. The game crashes instantly[cite: 1].\n\n### Crash Report Stacktrace\n```java\njava.lang.NullPointerException\n    at fi.dy.masa.litematica.render.schematic.RenderGlobalSchematic.func_174970_a(RenderGlobalSchematic.java:269)\n    at fi.dy.masa.litematica.render.LitematicaRenderer.piecewisePrepareAndUpdate(LitematicaRenderer.java:297)\n    at net.minecraft.client.renderer.EntityRenderer.handler$zzh000$litematica$setupAndUpdate(EntityRenderer.java:3238)\n```\n\n[crash-2026-09-24_11.06.53-client.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32598850/crash-2026-09-24_11.06.53-client.txt)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakura-ryoko/litematica/issues/400/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakura-ryoko/litematica/issues/400/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}